PRIMARY INTERPRETATION

The preregistered fit-gated canary policy passes the primary acceptance shape.

It:
- exceeds INDIVIDUAL mean net value;
- exceeds BLIND BROADCAST mean net value;
- uses far less evidence than FULL FAMILY CHECK;
- sharply reduces false promotion relative to BLIND BROADCAST;
- preserves broad family-level recovery at low evidence cost.

The result supports:

SHARED DEBT MEMORY
+
SMALL FRESH EVIDENCE PROBE
+
CONDITIONAL BROADCAST.

It does not support unconditional family promotion.

